{
  "description": "PII / redaction benchmark. MANUALLY ENTERED GROUND TRUTH: 'fields' labels every scored element on the page by DOM id as sensitive (personal or secret data that must not leave the device in text or pixels) or not. All values are dummy data. The page is laid out to fit inside a 1280x800 viewport so every field is inside the captured screenshot.",
  "groundTruthDefinition": "sensitive = the element's content is personal data identifying/contacting a person (name, email, phone, address, date of birth, national ID) or a secret/credential/payment datum (password, PIN, OTP, card number, CVV, API key). Non-sensitive = ordinary form content (search terms, quantities, dates of travel, order/tracking references, free-text feedback without PII).",
  "html": "<h1 style='margin:0 0 6px;font-size:20px'>Account &amp; checkout (benchmark)</h1><p id='display-email' class='display'>Registered email: asha.k@example.org</p><form onsubmit='return false' class='grid'><div><label for='f-fullname'>Full name</label><input id='f-fullname' value='Asha Kumar'></div><div><label for='f-email'>Email address</label><input id='f-email' type='email' value='asha.k@example.org'></div><div><label for='f-contact'>Contact</label><input id='f-contact' value='ravi.m@example.com'></div><div><label for='f-mobile'>Mobile number</label><input id='f-mobile' type='tel' value='+91 98765 43210'></div><div><label for='f-phone'>Phone</label><input id='f-phone' value='9876543210'></div><div><label for='f-password'>Password</label><input id='f-password' type='password' value='DemoPass!2026'></div><div><label for='f-confirm'>Confirm password</label><input id='f-confirm' type='password' autocomplete='new-password' value='DemoPass!2026'></div><div><label for='f-cc'>Card</label><input id='f-cc' autocomplete='cc-number' value=''></div><div><label for='f-payment'>Payment</label><input id='f-payment' value='4111 1111 1111 1111'></div><div><label for='f-cvv'>CVV</label><input id='f-cvv' maxlength='3' value='123'></div><div><label for='f-otp'>One-time code</label><input id='f-otp' autocomplete='one-time-code' value='482913'></div><div><label for='f-ssn'>Social security number</label><input id='f-ssn' value='123-45-6789'></div><div><label for='f-apikey'>API key</label><input id='f-apikey' value='sk-live-abcdef123456'></div><div><label for='f-aadhaar'>Aadhaar number</label><input id='f-aadhaar' value='1234 5678 9012'></div><div><label for='f-pin'>PIN</label><input id='f-pin' inputmode='numeric' value='4821'></div><div><label for='f-dob'>Date of birth</label><input id='f-dob' autocomplete='bday' value='1999-04-12'></div><div><label for='f-street'>Street address</label><input id='f-street' autocomplete='street-address' value='12 MG Road, Pune'></div><div><label for='f-notes'>Delivery notes</label><textarea id='f-notes' rows='1'>Call me at priya@example.com</textarea></div><div><label for='f-city'>City</label><input id='f-city' value='Pune'></div><div><label for='f-search'>Search</label><input id='f-search' type='search' placeholder='Search products' value='wireless mouse'></div><div><label for='f-qty'>Quantity</label><input id='f-qty' type='number' value='2'></div><div><label for='f-coupon'>Coupon code</label><input id='f-coupon' value='SAVE20'></div><div><label for='f-username'>Username</label><input id='f-username' value='asha_k'></div><div><label for='f-order'>Order number</label><input id='f-order' value='ORD-2026-000154'></div><div><label for='f-tracking'>Tracking ID</label><input id='f-tracking' value='7735 9812 4401 26'></div><div><label for='f-amount'>Amount (INR)</label><input id='f-amount' value='12,500'></div><div><label for='f-travel'>Travel date</label><input id='f-travel' type='date' value='2026-10-01'></div><div><label for='f-feedback'>Feedback</label><textarea id='f-feedback' rows='1'>Great service, thanks!</textarea></div></form>",
